    "text": "<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(d)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math></p><p>(e)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>So order of oxidation state</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math></p>"
